OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous levels' of noise on
OL,4,Asome Tube lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondoners on three major Tube lines are
OL,7,Fexperiencing "dangerous levels" of
OL,8,Fnoise while on the Underground network,
OL,9,Fa London Assembly member has said.
OL,11,FLabour's transport spokeswoman, Elly
OL,12,FBaker, who requested the data from the
OL,13,FMayor's Office and Transport for
OL,14,FLondon, (TfL) also said the noise
OL,15,Flevels raised "serious questions about
OL,16,Fthe conditions passengers are
OL,17,Ftravelling in".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
