OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1793640413
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous levels' of noise on
OL,4,Asome Tube lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictoria, Northern and Jubilee lines
OL,7,Fpassengers also face levels of more
OL,8,Fthan 100 decibels (dB) - louder than a
OL,9,Fnearby chainsaw or power tool. The data
OL,10,Falso showed the network had 707 noise
OL,11,Fcomplaints over the past three years.
OL,13,FTfL said minimising noise levels is a
OL,14,F"priority" and it is taking action to
OL,15,Freduce rail-grinding.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
